This file documents the revision history for Coocook.

0.06  NEXT
    - add support for automatic repair of database inconsistencies found by coocook_dbck.pl

0.05  2024-09-09 Codename "Großeinkauf"
    - add feature of default purchase lists, remove page "unassigned items"
    - complete overhaul of purchase list editor and print view
    - fix/improve many calculations in special cases of add/change/remove items/ingredients
    - modern and appealing styling of many pages using Bootstrap framework
    - allow setting an arbitrary date for meals in modal for editing meal details
      (additionally to moving meals to other days by drag & drop)
    - add helpful explanations to bottom of many pages
    - add Content Security Policy (CSP) for improved security
    - remove inline Javascript code, pass all data as pure JSON and even stricter CSP

0.04  2023-07-19 Codename "Nachtwache"
    - add recipe(s) of the day
    - drop config for custom texts, use custom templates instead
    - allow users to change their email address
    - don't send password reset emails to inexistent accounts
    - hide user profile from search engines and anonymous users
    - modernize user interface with Bootstrap framework
    - add interactive drag & drop editor for meals & dishes and for dish/recipe ingredients
    - allow free ordering of meals and dishes by drag & drop
    - move code, issue tracker, etc. from GitHub.com to GitLab.com
    - remove concept of quantities #118
    - remove dedicated print page but improve print layout of normal web pages like print overview

0.03  2020-12-28 Codename "Krippenspiel"
    - user interface based on Bootstrap framework
    - revisit registration page
    - organizations
    - browse public recipes
    - import of single recipes from other projects
    - project descriptions in Markdown format
    - archiving of projects
    - admin pages
    - pages for FAQ and Terms & Conditions
    - anti-spam techniques
    - database consistency check script
    - Dockerfile for development with Docker
    - PostgreSQL support
    - switch to GNU Affero General Public License v3

0.02  2018-01-15 Codename "Fruchtparadies"
    - user self-registration
    - import data from a previous project
    - public/private projects and project permissions
    - independent data per project
    - Perl dependencies cpanfile + Makefile.PL in Git repository

0.01  2015-04-27 02:33:28
    - initial revision, generated by Catalyst
